        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Mul-T-Lock TSR25 Heavy Duty Round Padlock Round Body Padlock With 7/16\" Shackle</b>\r\n<p>\r\nHigh security hardened steel round body padlock that is ideal for service vans, utility vans, delivery trucks, trailers and building doors. This very popular round body padlock design has a standard length 7/16\" diameter hardened Boron Steel Shackle to prevent cutting attempts. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nMUL-T-LOCK's high security lock cylinders are designed to provide superior protection with uncompromised key control. The Key Card owner is the only person allowed to have the keys duplicated.  Remove the worry about anyone making duplicates of your keys. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>Supplied standard with 1 owner key card per key combination and 2 keys per lock cylinder.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-41026-SM.jpg?v=1704354526\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"MUL-T-LOCK TSR25 round padlock size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/mul-t-lock-round-body-padlock-with-long-7-16-shackle\"><b>Mul-T-Lock TSR50 Long Shackle Round Padlock</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/mul-t-lock-tr100-heavy-duty-round-padlock\"><b>Shackle-Less Round Padlock</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe shackle is locked with a double ball bearing mechanism. 55 degree key rotation unlocks the padlock. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Mul-T-Lock TSR25 Round Padlock\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>7/16\" Diameter Hardened Boron Alloy Shackle</li>\r\n<li>Steel Round Padlock Body with Satin Chrome Finish</li>\r\n<li>Drill and Pick Resistant Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Bump Proof Design</li>\r\n<li>Mul-T-Lock 206SP Security Keyway</li>\r\n<li>MUL-T-LOCK's Patented Interactive Key Control System</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Mul-T-Lock TSR25 Padlock\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Shackle Diameter: 7/16\" (11mm)</li>\r\n<li>Padlock Body Height: 2-3/16\" (55mm)</li>\r\n<li>Padlock Body Width: 1-3/4\" (63mm)</li>\r\n<li>Padlock Body Thickness: 1-1/16\" (27mm)</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1\" (25mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mul-T-Lock Security Keyway: 206SP</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 Keys per Lock</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TSR25.pdf?v=1704262191\" target=\"new\"><b>Mul-T-Lock TSR25 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If ordering multiple locks you can have them Key Alike (use the same key) or Keyed Different (different keys for each lock). You can also order <a href=\"/products/cut-keys-for-mul-t-lock-locksets-and-padlocks\">Extra Keys Cut</a> below if more than the standard 2 keys are required.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Mul-T-Lock Round Body Padlock With 7/16 Shackle",
                "description": "Mul-T-Lock 206SP-TSR25 - High security hardened steel round body padlock that is ideal for service vans, utility vans, delivery trucks, trailers and building doors. This very popular round body padlock design has a standard length 7/16 inch diameter hardened Boron Steel Shackle to prevent cutting attempts. ",
                "keywords": "MTL-206SP-TSR25 Heavy Duty Long Shackle Round Padlocks, Mul-T-Lock Round Body Padlock 7/16 Shackles, Mul-T-Lock high security padlocks, Mul-T-Lock restricted keyway, Mul-T-Lock restricted keys, Mul-T-Lock TSR25 padlocks, Mul-T-Lock 206S-TSR25 padlocks, truck padlocks, van padlocks, trailer padlocks,"
